        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 1 It is up to the implementation whether to give a response code FAILED or WARNING_WPT. In case of FAILED, the communication is terminated. In case of WARNING_WPT, the system allows to repeat the positioning and pairing procedure.",
