        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5018] If the SECC has identified a pairing code it shall respond to a WPT_PairingReq with a WPT_PairingRes message with the parameter ObservedIDCode set to the pairing identification code and the EVSEProcessing parameter set to \"Finished\".",
