        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5053] If [V2G20-5016] applies or the EVCC sent a WPT_PairingReq with the parameter EVResultCode set to \"EVResultFailed, then the SECC should include AlternativeSECCList parameter in the PairingRes message when such information is available.",
            "block_bbox": [
