        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The WPT_ChargeParameterDiscoveryReq and WPT_ChargeParameterDiscoveryRes messages are used to exchange information about the technical characteristics of the power transfer devices in order to tune the system components, accordingly.",
